vesktop (1.6.9-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
  - Considerably improved Rich Presence. Now much faster and should detect way more
    games. Also supports full Discord RPC now, which means apps like Discord Streamkit
    Overlay should now work with Vesktop
  - fixed the Discord titlebar having no close/maximise/minimise buttons
  - fixed various Linux screenshare audio issues
  - KDE: fixed tray icon not working when using autostart
  - modernised the screenshare implementation
  - fixed popout windows having no titlebar
  - fixed an issue where portable Windows installs may be updated to the Setup version
  - now better handles errors when Vencord fails to load & offers to Repair

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:26:41 +0100

vesktop (1.6.8-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
    - Updated Electron to address the recent eMudhra certificate authority
      security issue which undermines trust in affected certificates.
      This does not mean Vesktop was compromised, but updating is strongly
      recommended.
    - Fixed various issues related to screenshare with system audio on Linux
    - Improved the Native titlebar setting
    - Fixed not being able to zoom with Numpad +/-
    - Fixed various titlebar issues

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:57:57 +0200

